# COPY-PASTA — Recommended Cursor model

When creating or editing a `COPY-PASTA.md` (or `*-COPY-PASTA.md`) file, **every prompt** must tell
the operator which Cursor model to use before pasting.

## Required

- Include **`Cursor model:`** (or a phase-level table with a Model column) on **each** prompt.
- Prefer: **Auto** (cheapest), **Codex 5.3** (medium), **Opus 4.8** (premium).
- Match tier to risk: mechanical/docs → Auto; standard features → Codex 5.3; native/engine/assembly → Opus 4.8.

## When none of the three fit

Name the alternative model explicitly and add one sentence explaining why (rare).

